 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Starting a list",
     "texto": [
      "**N을/를 비롯해서** presents a highlighted element and adds others from the same group: 주민**들을 비롯해서** 많은 사람이 왔어요 = a lot of people came, including the residents. The particle **을/를** depends on whether N ends in a consonant or a vowel.",
      "The expression also appears before another noun: **N을/를 비롯한 + noun**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Variant before a noun",
     "texto": [
      "**N을/를 비롯해서** introduces a clause; **N을/를 비롯한** modifies the noun that follows: 서울**을 비롯해서** 여러 도시에서… / 서울**을 비롯한** 여러 도시에서… = in several cities, including Seoul. It is common in lists and informative texts; it is not limited exclusively to formal writing."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
